cff-version: 1.2.0
title: CpCDV genome analysis
message: Please cite this repository if you use the code or data.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Radouane
    given-names: Nabil
    affiliation: African Genome Center, University Mohammed VI Polytechnic (UM6P)
repository-code: "https://github.com/red1nabil-lab/cpcdv-genome-analysis"
abstract: >-
  Whole-genome reassessment of strain designations in chickpea chlorotic dwarf virus
  (Mastrevirus cicerparvi), covering origin normalisation of circular genomes, pairwise
  identity under the genus demarcation procedure, nucleotide diversity, maximum-likelihood
  phylogeny and recombination analysis.
license: MIT
